## 🚀 How to Test

### 1. Start Backend API (Required)
```powershell
cd C:\Code_Scripts\Python\va-disability-calculator
python -m src.project_name.api
# API runs on http://localhost:5000
```

### 2. Start Frontend Development Server
```powershell
cd C:\Code_Scripts\website\aws-deployment-kit\portfolio
npm run dev
# Portfolio runs on http://localhost:5173
```

### 3. Test Routes
- **Home:** http://localhost:5173/
- **Veterans:** http://localhost:5173/veterans
- **Calculator:** http://localhost:5173/veterans/calculator

### 4. Test Features

#### Body Diagram:
- Click on body parts (knees, shoulders, etc.)
- Verify rating modal appears
- Enter rating and condition name
- Check bilateral pair detection (try both knees)

#### Calculator:
- Add multiple conditions
- Add bilateral pairs (left & right knee)
- Fill in dependents form
- Click "Calculate Rating & Payment"
- Verify results display correctly
- Test CSV download

#### Navigation:
- Click "Veterans" in navbar (should turn green)
- Test all menu items
- Test mobile menu (resize browser)

