## 🔗 API Integration

The frontend connects to these backend endpoints:

1. **`POST /api/v1/calculate-bilateral`**
   - Used when bilateral conditions detected
   - Sends bilateral_conditions, other_conditions, dependents

2. **`POST /api/v1/calculate-full`**
   - Used for non-bilateral calculations
   - Sends conditions, dependents

### API Configuration:
```javascript
const API_BASE = 'http://localhost:5000';  // Development
